  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In X posts from 2025 and 2026, Christopher Landau referenced AI in remarks about AI-generated images and a self-driving car ride. As Deputy Secretary of State, he said one of his posts was not AI-generated and criticized the publication of an AI hallucination derived from a headline. He said AI is going to “change everything” and cited India’s participation in the Pax Silica initiative to develop technologies with mutually beneficial supply chains, while warning that no nation should monopolize supply chains. He also said AI should supplement rather than supplant human intelligence and creativity, and said the “chimera” of AI global governance in organizations like the United Nations must be dispelled.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s7",
